  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthened evidence-based, country-driven advocacy</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective is to strengthen NRC&apos;s evidence-based, country-driven advocacy to protect the rights of people affected by conflict, including: Improving protection of civilians, Improving access to assistance, secure better protection of children&apos;s right to education an Improve respect for the rights for displaced people and returnees.</narrative>
  </description>
